---
layout: base.njk
title: Laser Hair Removal Blog for Men in Riyadh
description: Educational articles on laser hair removal, treatment preparation, and aftercare for men in Riyadh.
---
<section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-20 text-center">
  <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight">
    Laser Hair Removal <span class="text-accent">for Men</span> in Riyadh
  </h1>
  <p class="text-muted mt-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg">
    Educational articles by Nurse James on laser hair reduction, treatment preparation, and aftercare.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-8 flex gap-4 justify-center flex-wrap">
    <a href="/blog/" class="bg-accent text-bg font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded">Read the Blog</a>
    <a href="{{ site.whatsapp }}" target="_blank" class="border border-white/20 px-6 py-3 rounded">Ask on WhatsApp</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 pb-20">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-8">Latest Articles</h2>
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
    {% for post in collections.posts | reverse | slice(0, 6) %}
    <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="block border border-white/10 rounded-lg p-6 hover:border-accent/60 transition">
      {% if post.data.category %}<span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">{{ post.data.category }}</span>{% endif %}
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-2 mb-2">{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
      <p class="text-muted text-sm">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>